 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Verbo + persona + to + forma base",
     "texto": [
      "Con **want, ask, tell, expect, remind, encourage, persuade, force, beg** y **order** (ordenar a alguien), usa **verbo + persona + to + verbo**: **I want you to come**; **She told me to wait**; **They ordered us to leave**.",
      "No confundas **tell me that...** (decirme que...) con **tell me to...** (decirme que haga algo)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Allow, let y help",
     "texto": [
      "**Allow + persona + to + verbo**: **They allow us to park here**. **Let + persona + verbo base**, sin **to**: **Let me help you**. Con **help**, se admiten las dos formas: **Help me (to) carry this**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
